<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88509" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσάλληλος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one with</i> or
				<i>against another,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				4.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ach.Tat.
				2.38
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>congenial,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. καρπὸς πόπῳ</span> prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				2.2.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>mutual,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>D.</u>
				3.14
			</span></i>; <i>correlative,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Syrian.
				<u>in Metaph.</u>
				34.23
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
